DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART:20260923T000511Z
DTEND:20260923T010511Z
SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox 2026 · 秋分
DESCRIPTION:The sun crosses the equator again, heading south.\n\nFrom here, northern nights grow longer until winter solstice.\n\nhttps://pilgrimapp.org/sunpath/2026-autumn-equinox
URL:https://pilgrimapp.org/sunpath/2026-autumn-equinox
CATEGORIES:Equinox,Astronomy
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Autumn Equinox tomorrow — the sun crosses the equator heading south
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
