DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART:20261221T205013Z
DTEND:20261221T215013Z
SUMMARY:Winter Solstice 2026 · 冬至
DESCRIPTION:The sun reaches its furthest south. The longest northern night.\n\nFrom here, light returns. Northern days grow until summer solstice.\n\nhttps://pilgrimapp.org/sunpath/2026-winter-solstice
URL:https://pilgrimapp.org/sunpath/2026-winter-solstice
CATEGORIES:Solstice,Astronomy
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Winter Solstice tomorrow — the longest dark, and the turning back toward light
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
